              "stem": "A 60-year old male patient suffering from hypertension and benign prostatic hyperplasia presents to the hospital.\nWhich drug would you recommend for this patient?(1 Mark)\nWhat is the mode of action of the drugs mentioned in a) above?(2 Marks)\nState 4 side effects of the drug mentioned in a) above.(2 Marks)",
