              "stem": "A 64-year-old woman suffering from episodic heartburn routinely took an over-the-counter medication as needed. The drug acts by inhibiting the action of an endogenous compound released from enterochromaffin-like cells of the stomach. Which of the following drugs did the patient most likely take?",
